  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Ukrainians with electricity generators</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">After Russia&apos;s massive attacks on Ukraine&apos;s critical infrastructure facilities, energy companies are running out of supplies of materials and equipment to restore networks. The need for power equipment (electric generators) for the needs of children and the elderly has sharply increased. Getting the electricity generator they get no problems with heating, cooking and lighting during the winter.</narrative>
  </description>
